    listenerCharacterName: "\u0425\u0430\u043D\u043D\u0430"
    isListenerOnRight: 1
    flipListenerImage: 1
    showCollectibleView: 1
    collectibleTitle: Letter from Aunt Mira
    collectibleContent: "From: Mirel De\u2019Lamo\r\nTo: Eli Harred\r\n\r\n\"Hello,
      my dear nephew,\r\n\r\nI don\u2019t want to drag this out. I can\u2019t keep
      it to myself any longer\u2026 Your parents are dead. They were killed in a
      plane crash. I was surprised you weren\u2019t with them. At first I thought
      you had survived by some miracle - but you were in the hot zone when Dark Day
      hit.\r\n\r\nWhen the flight your parents were on lost contact with air traffic
      control, they\u2026 were unlucky: two flights collided. The other flight survived,
      landing on an island.\r\n\r\nI am so sorry this happened\u2026 Forgive me for
      not telling you sooner.\r\n\r\nKnow that if fate ever favors us, and we can
      meet, I will always be glad to see you.\r\n\r\nAunt Mira\"\r\n"
    collectibleIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a42c8ec0ff27c024fab127cffe55cef1, type: 3}
