  - text: "Let\u2019s see\u2026"
    speakerName: Eli
    characterName: "\u0418\u043B\u0430\u0439"
    isRadio: 0
    changeSpeakerName: 0
    changeCharacterSprite: 0
    changeBackground: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    backgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3c98e7bc91917364bb64da9c94dc4afc, type: 3}
    backgroundId: 5
    isOnRight: 0
    flipSpeakerImage: 0
    listenerCharacterName: 
    isListenerOnRight: 0
    flipListenerImage: 0
    showCollectibleView: 1
    collectibleTitle: Generator unit assembly notes
    collectibleContent: "For apprentices:\r\n\r\nBuild the circuit as a single series
      line - components connected one after another. Reminder:\r\n\r\n1. Power source
      (battery): It goes first in the circuit and supplies voltage. Connect from
      the positive terminal (+) first, otherwise you\u2019ll blow the diodes.\r\n\r\n2.
      Wire: Used to connect components. The wire\u2019s resistance is negligible,
      but the contact must be as tight and clean as possible, or you\u2019ll get
      voltage drop.\r\n\r\n3. Resistor: Install it right after the wire. Its job
      is to limit current. Do not connect the load directly, otherwise the source
      will overheat or you\u2019ll blow a fuse.\r\n\r\n4. Switch: Install it at the
      very end, before connecting to the negative terminal (\u2013). It must break
      the entire circuit, not just one branch. When it\u2019s OFF, no part of the
      circuit should remain energized.\r\n\r\nImportant:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Do not submit
      the circuit without the resistor.\r\n\u2022 The switch must not be for show.
      It must cut power to the entire circuit.\r\n\u2022 Polarity matters.\r\n\u2022
      After assembly, check it with a multimeter: current should flow only after
      the switch is closed.\r\n\r\n\u2014 Master G.H.\r"
    collectibleIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a42c8ec0ff27c024fab127cffe55cef1, type: 3}
    showItemNotification: 1
    itemName: Generator unit assem...
    itemType: Collectible Item
    itemRarity: 3
    itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a42c8ec0ff27c024fab127cffe55cef1, type: 3}
    showStoryNotification: 0
    storyNotificationText: 
    storyNotificationDuration: 0
